# Site Header Content

The site header must contain only:

- The Utility Infielder title linking to the homepage
- The Portfolio link to `https://artkleinart.com`

Do not add Last Arcade, Techno Bowl, or other project-specific navigation links
to the header unless Art explicitly asks to change this rule.
